        "text_en": "First of all, a patient with Prameha, previously anointed with some oil or with ghee prepared with the Priyangvadi group, should be given an emetic, and thereafter a strong purgative. Once purified, he is given a Basti with a decoction of Surasa and similar herbs together with the addition of Mahaushadhi, Bhadradaru and Musta, mixed with honey and Saindhava salt; and, in case of burning, a Basti with a decoction of the Nyagrodhadi group without oil."
