        "text_en": "Pancha-shirisha-agada: A drink consisting of a decoction of the roots, flowers, bark, seeds, and shoots of the Shirisha tree, taken with honey, the five kinds of medicinal salt, and an abundant quantity of trikatu powder, acts quickly in poisoning from an insect bite."
