        "text_en": "Sarva-kamika-agada: The agada prepared from Kushtha, Trikatu, Darvi, the flowers of Madhuka, two kinds of salt (saindhava and sauvarchala), the flowers of Malati, Nagapushpa, and all the medicines of the madhura (kakolyadi) group, ground with the juice of Kapittha and mixed with honey and sugar, destroys all kinds of venom, especially the venom of the mouse (mushika)."
